ment Background Mode to Clear Color in the MRP, otherwise both HDR 2D disabled and enabled would be tinted slightly blue because of the Sky background mode that was used in the provided MRP. The behaviour with the blue sky background is not what is described in this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5208778004/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5208993098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120041#issuecomment-5208993098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120041","id":5208993098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNnrtSg","user":{"login":"BoraYalcinn","id":195580819,"node_id":"U_kgDOC6hTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195580819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn","html_url":"https://github.com/BoraYalcinn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T20:42:39Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T20:42:39Z","body":"Same here ,tested on NVIDIA RTX 5070 (Linux), no purple tint, matches @allenwp.\n\nAlso tried it on AMD RX 9070XT (Windows) and couldn't reproduce it there either. So probably not an AMD vs NVIDIA thing — might be specific to older AMD cards/drivers, since the original report was on an RX 580.\n\n@MrSolaire810 what driver version are you on? If it turns out to be a driver-specific quirk rather than a Godot bug, this might not need a code fix on our end.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5208993098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5209124764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120041#issuecomment-5209124764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120041","id":5209124764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNnzvnA","user":{"login":"MrSolaire810","id":184316402,"node_id":"U_kgDOCvxx8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184316402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrSolaire810","html_url":"https://github.com/MrSolaire810","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrSolaire810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrSolaire810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrSolaire810/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrSolaire810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrSolaire810/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrSolaire810/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrSolaire810/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrSolaire810/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrSolaire810/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T21:06:13Z","upd